@char AnAn.Default,Angle01/Arms>Arms01,Angle01/Option_Arms>Option_Arms01_03,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Neutral_Open,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Closed
